  <name>VideoMix</name>
  <summary>Compose videos from clips of multiple videos</summary>
  <description>
    <p>VideoMix lets you build a single output video out of clips taken from several source videos, arranging them on a timeline and rendering the result with ffmpeg (included).</p>
    <p>VideoMix is a fork of LosslessCut by Mikael Finstad (https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut).</p>
  </description>
